# Keep this directory in git.
#
# This directory is the recommended location for markdown reports
# generated by skills such as:
#   - /memory-checks
#   - /check-work
#   - /code-review
#
# Example files:
#   2026-07-16-memory-check.md
#   2026-07-16-check-work-verdict.md
#
# These files are explicitly allowed in .gitignore.
# They contain important audit / verification history and should be committed.